<title>USA: Enron Corp sets $200 mln in 12-yr debt.</title>
<headline>Enron Corp sets $200 mln in 12-yr debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Enron Corp was priced on Thursday via sole manager Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p>Houston-based Enron, is a large diversified global energy company.</p>
<p>BORROWER ENRON CORP</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON  6.750     MATURITY 08/01/09</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.286  FIRST PAY DATE</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD   6.838     PAY FREQ SEMI</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P  BBB-PLUS SPREAD  68 BP     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>** ISSUE HAS MAKE-WHOLE CALL AT 15 BPS OVER TREASURIES</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1675))</p>
</text>
